  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 263 * 225 * 5 * 76 * 98 * 3\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1): ÷ − + × =\n\n263 * 225 * 5 * 76 * 98 * 3 ⇒ 263 ÷ 225 - 5 + 76 × 98 = 3\n\n⇒ __**263 ÷**____** 225**__ - 5 + 76 × 98 = 3\n\n⇒ 1.16 - 5 + __**76 **____**×**____** 98**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**1.16 + 7448**__ - 5 = 3\n\n⇒ __**7449.16 - 5**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 7444.16 ≠ 3 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): = − + × ÷\n\n263 * 225 * 5 * 76 * 98 * 3 ⇒ 263 = 225 - 5 + 76 × 98 ÷ 3\n\n⇒ 263 = 225 - 5 + 76 × __**98 **____**÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ 263 = 225 - 5 + __**76 **____**× 32.67**__\n\n⇒ 263 = __**225 + 2482.92**__ - 5\n\n⇒ 263 = __2707.92** - 5**__\n\n⇒ 263 ≠ 2702.92 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): = − ÷ + ×\n\n263 * 225 * 5 * 76 * 98 * 3 ⇒ 263 = 225 - 5 ÷ 76 + 98 × 3\n\n⇒ 263 = 225 - __**5 **____**÷**____** 76**__ + 98 × 3\n\n⇒ 263 = 225 - 0.06 + __**98 **____**× 3**__\n\n⇒ 263 = __**225 + 294**__ - 0.06\n\n⇒ 263 = __519** **____**- 0.06**__\n\n⇒ 263 ≠ 518.94 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): = ÷ − + × \n\n263 * 225 * 5 * 76 * 98 * 3 ⇒ 263 = 225 ÷ 5 - 76 + 98 × 3\n\n⇒ 263 = __**225 **____**÷**____** 5**__ - 76 + 98 × 3\n\n⇒ 263 = 45 - 76 + __**98 **____**× 3**__\n\n⇒ 263 = __**45 + 294**__ - 76\n\n⇒ 263 = __339____** - 76**__\n\n**⇒ 263 = 263 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
